<https://fhir-ig.digitalhealth.gov.ng/ConceptMap/NgHivLocalToLOINC> a fhir:ConceptMap ;
  fhir:nodeRole fhir:treeRoot ;
  fhir:Resource.id [ fhir:value "NgHivLocalToLOINC"] ;
  fhir:DomainResource.text [
     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "generated" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap NgHivLocalToLOINC</b></p><a name=\"NgHivLocalToLOINC\"> </a><a name=\"hcNgHivLocalToLOINC\"> </a><p>Mapping from <a href=\"ValueSet-ng-hiv-local-concepts.html\">Nigeria HIV Local Concepts</a> to <a href=\"ValueSet-ng-hiv-loinc-concepts.html\">Nigeria HIV LOINC Concepts</a></p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-art-follow-up-status-cs.html\">HIV Follow Up Status CodeSystem</a> to <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-loinc.html\">Logical Observation Identifiers, Names and Codes (LOINC)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>to (Transfer out)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>45256-5 (HIV treatment clinic transferred to)</td></tr><tr><td>dead</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>77978-5 (Patient died from illness of interest)</td></tr><tr><td>drop</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>45257-3 (Date dropped from HIV treatment)</td></tr><tr><td>restart</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>63936-9 (Start date of treatment or therapy)</td></tr><tr><td>lost (Lost to follow-up)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>45237-5 (Date lost to HIV treatment follow-up)</td></tr><tr><td>stop (Stopped treatment)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>91382-2 (Date medication stopped - Reported)</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 2 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-arv-adherence-cs.html\">HIV-ARV Adherence CodeSystem</a> to <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-loinc.html\">Logical Observation Identifiers, Names and Codes (LOINC)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>Stopped</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>91382-2 (Date medication stopped - Reported)</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 3 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-yes-no-cs.html\">Yes/No Codes</a> to <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-loinc.html\">Logical Observation Identifiers, Names and Codes (LOINC)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>true (Yes)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>LA29252-6 (Currently breastfeeding)</td></tr><tr><td>false (No)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>LA29253-4 (Not currently breastfeeding)</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 4 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-dsd-reason-for-category-change-cs.html\">HIV DSD - Reason For Category Change CodeSystem</a> to <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-loinc.html\">Logical Observation Identifiers, Names and Codes (LOINC)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>Dead</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>77978-5 (Patient died from illness of interest)</td></tr><tr><td>Lost</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>45237-5 (Date lost to HIV treatment follow-up)</td></tr><tr><td>TO</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>45256-5 (HIV treatment clinic transferred to)</td></tr><tr><td>Unknown</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>LA29947-1 (Carrier status unknown)</td></tr><tr><td>Other</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>LA46-8 (Other)</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 5 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-patient-education-level-cs.html\">HIV Patient Education Level Codes</a> to <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-loinc.html\">Logical Observation Identifiers, Names and Codes (LOINC)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>No-Education</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>LA35-1 (No schooling)</td></tr><tr><td>Primary</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>LA32466-7 (Primary school education)</td></tr><tr><td>Secondary</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>LA32467-5 (High school education)</td></tr><tr><td>Tertiary</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>LA15568-1 (Graduated from a college or university)</td></tr><tr><td>TVET</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>LA39-3 (Technical or trade school)</td></tr><tr><td>Other (Other, specify)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>LA46-8 (Other)</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 6 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-positive-tracking-cs.html\">HIV Positive Tracking</a> to <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-loinc.html\">Logical Observation Identifiers, Names and Codes (LOINC)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>Started-ART</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>63936-9 (Start date of treatment or therapy)</td></tr><tr><td>Final-Outcome</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>63939-3 (End date of treatment or therapy)</td></tr><tr><td>Linked-To-Care (Linked to care and treatment)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>67723-7 (Date of health-related event)</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 7 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-yes-no-cs.html\">Yes/No Codes</a> to <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-loinc.html\">Logical Observation Identifiers, Names and Codes (LOINC)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>true (Yes)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>LA26438-4 (Yes, I want to become pregnant)</td></tr><tr><td>false (No)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>LA26440-0 (No, I don't want to become pregnant)</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 8 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-yes-no-cs.html\">Yes/No Codes</a> to <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-loinc.html\">Logical Observation Identifiers, Names and Codes (LOINC)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>true (Yes)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>LA15173-0 (Pregnant)</td></tr><tr><td>false (No)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>LA26683-5 (Not pregnant)</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 9 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-service-provider-cs.html\">HIV Service Providers CodeSystem</a> to <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-loinc.html\">Logical Observation Identifiers, Names and Codes (LOINC)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>Other (Other (Specify))</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>LA46-8 (Other)</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 10 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-final-outcome-cs.html\">HIV - Final Outcome CodeSystem</a> to <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-loinc.html\">Logical Observation Identifiers, Names and Codes (LOINC)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>started-art</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>63936-9 (Start date of treatment or therapy)</td></tr><tr><td>died</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>81954-0 (Date of death [Date])</td></tr><tr><td>confirmed-referral</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>39266-2 (Follow-up (referred to) provider /specialist Set CPHS)</td></tr><tr><td>started-art-in-other-hf</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>45235-9 (Date original clinic HIV treatment start)</td></tr><tr><td>lost-to-follow-up</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>45237-5 (Date lost to HIV treatment follow-up)</td></tr><tr><td>other</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>LA46-8 (Other)</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 11 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-tb-tpt-prophylaxis-type-cs.html\">TB TPT Prophylaxis Type Codes</a> to <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-loinc.html\">Logical Observation Identifiers, Names and Codes (LOINC)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>inh</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>18934-0 (Isoniazid [Susceptibility])</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 12 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-reason-not-started-art-cs.html\">HIV - Reason Not Started ART CodeSystem</a> to <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-loinc.html\">Logical Observation Identifiers, Names and Codes (LOINC)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>referred-tx-not-initiated</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>LP73973-7 (Date patient referred for treatment)</td></tr><tr><td>died</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>LA4645-3 (Patient Died Before Therapy)</td></tr><tr><td>known-positive-on-art (Known +ve on ART)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>45231-8 (HIV treatment prior to enrollment)</td></tr><tr><td>on-oi-management</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>47244-9 (Symptom, diagnosis, or opportunistic infection related to HIV treatment)</td></tr><tr><td>other (Other Specify here)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>LA46-8 (Other)</td></tr></table></div>"
